rem Amoebas in a 2D Grid
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=762

use numbers
use sequences
use linalg
use io
use cli

arg Count integer = 100000
arg Mod integer = 1000000000

rem C(n) satisfies an order-8 linear
rem recurrence (checked against C(2),
rem C(10), C(20), C(100) of the
rem statement). Its companion matrix
rem advances the window C(n-7)..C(n).
Seed = array 1 2 4 9 20 46 105 243
Coef = array 4 -2 4 -5 -3 -1 2 2
Cells = array shape 64 fill 0
Diag = 0 to 6
Cells (Diag * 9 + 1) = 1
Cells (56 to 63) = (Coef + Mod) mod Mod
Step = Cells reshape 8 8
Power = (Count - 8) max 0
Jump = Step matpow Power mod Mod
Window = Jump matmul Seed mod Mod
Early = array 1 1 2 4 9 20 46 105 243
Known = Early (Count min 8)
Small = Count less 9
Answer = Small choose Known (Window 7)
Answer print
